{"id":"93417629b5b8941f","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-congruence-identity.md","title":"Congruence Identity","display":"Congruence Identity","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-congruence-identity","aliases":["93-fact-congruence-identity"],"display":"Congruence Identity","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-df-abelian]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-congruence-identity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-congruence-identity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Congruence Identity"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-congruence-identity-—-Congruence-Identity\">fact-congruence-identity — Congruence Identity</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-,-]\">\\([-,-]\\)</span> is the commutator on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is the diagonal congruence.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\to\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl([\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\to\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl([\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the defining commutator identity for an abelian algebra.  The\nprevious equalities <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,1]=\\theta\">\\([\\theta,1]=\\theta\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,\\theta]=\\theta\">\\([\\theta,\\theta]=\\theta\\)</span> had\nthe direction appropriate to an idempotent commutator, not an abelian one.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-congruence-identity-—-Congruence-Identity","text":"fact-congruence-identity — Congruence Identity","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-abelian]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}","display":false},{"tex":"[-,-]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\to\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl([\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"[\\theta,1]=\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"[\\theta,\\theta]=\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":997,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","135c0cfcbae1f3c5","e2be868cf664b716"]}